            "field125": "<p>公共交通&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;自驾</p>\n<p><strong>之江馆区：</strong></p>\n<article class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie=\"[&quot;root&quot;,{&quot;copyFrom&quot;:&quot;im-native&quot;},[&quot;p&quot;,{},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#171A1D&quot;},&quot;之江馆区公共交通：市内公交324M路/1499路/500&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#171A1D&quot;},&quot;路/1411路/8514路至浙江省博物馆之江馆站/碧波路文景路口站，或者乘坐地铁6号线至之江文化中心站/枫桦西路站。&quot;]]]]\">\n<p>之江馆区公共交通：市内公交324M路/1499路/500</p>\n<p>路/1411路/8514路至浙江省博物馆之江馆站/碧波路文景路口站，或者乘坐地铁6号线至之江文化中心站/枫桦西路站。</p>\n</article>\n<p><strong>孤山馆区：</strong>市内公交宋城千古情号西湖外环线、WE1314路,</p>\n<p>可直达浙江省博物馆孤山馆区。</p>",
